{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2860,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trees are some of the \nbiggest organisms on the planet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6520,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but where do they get that matter to grow?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9240,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Man: Rich nutrients out the ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11580,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Man: Start with soil or in the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12809,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Man: Goodness out of the soil, I suppose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15180,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek Muller: Comes out of the soil?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15900,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Man: Yeah..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17560,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek Muller: Yeah..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18340,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek Muller: Goodness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19460,
    "dDurationMs": 610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Man: Goodness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20070,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek Muller: Why isn't there a big hole \naround the tree where it's taking out all the soil?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23850,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Man (right): 'Cause it does it so \ngradually that the soil is time to recover."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28560,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek Muller: Now, I think it's intuitive to believe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30660,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the tree gets most of its mass from the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32099,
    "dDurationMs": 4021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "soil because you can see those roots\ndigging into the soil and they must be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36120,
    "dDurationMs": 5099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taking something out of there and I mean\na tree looks like dirt and it feels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41220,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "solid like dirt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43920,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45380,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the early 1600 a scientist \nnamed Johann Baptist Van Helmholt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49740,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tried to figure out where the mass\nof a tree was coming from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52340,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he got a pot of soil and very carefully \nmeasured the amount of soil in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57680,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then he planted the tree and  \ntook care of it for five years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61120,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making sure that no soil left or was added to his pot ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65540,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the end of this experiment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66869,
    "dDurationMs": 2931,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he was weighted the tree \nto find that it was 72 kilograms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69800,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the massive soil had\nonly decreased by about 60 grams."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73860,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was pretty strong evidence that the\nmass of the tree does not come from the soil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77960,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've never thought about that actually\nbecause they don't really eat anything, trees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82560,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't eat anything?\n--No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83980,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't eat anything?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84880,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Water, it's all basically absorbed.\n--That's all they eat?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87120,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah.\n--They don't eat anything else?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88740,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No.\n--That's all they eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90880,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well presumably from the water \nand the nutrients from the soil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94720,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there anything else that you need \nbesides the soil and the water?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97760,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I suppose that's all you need, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99640,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To make--\n--Other than the original seed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103100,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for that particular tree, I suppose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104880,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The seed, the soil, and the water and\nthat makes this big tree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108720,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek Muller: Of course Johann Baptist Van Helmholt\ndid conclude that the tree was made entirely of water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114140,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now while that's not correct \nat least he was on the right track"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117220,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "realizing that the matter of a tree \ndoesn't  come out of the soil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120500,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sun energy, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123060,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sun energy?\n--Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124220,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are they converting energy into mass or--?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127300,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you know what I mean?\n--Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128200,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like that there wasn't stuff and then  there was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130420,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where did that stuff come from?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131860,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Magic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133380,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[laughing]\nI have no idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136140,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My question is where do they \nget that mass to grow big?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139440,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140580,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Get it from the rain and the sun presuably."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144460,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Light.\n--Sunlight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145960,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sunshine.\nThe sunshine?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148320,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does the sunshine add mass to the tree?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153240,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It would need sunshine to grow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155440,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, they wouldn't grow without it.\nI don't know whether it adds mass,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159160,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they wouldn't go without it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160760,
    "dDurationMs": 5699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course the sun's energy is needed for\nthe tree to build the matter into its"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166459,
    "dDurationMs": 4981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "branches and leaves but the Sun itself\nthe energy is not matter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172220,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well I suppose you've got to put air into this as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175560,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's got to be something, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178820,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is it about the air?\n--A gas in the air that it needs as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182120,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oxygen.\nThe trees need the oxygen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186020,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I guess oxygen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188240,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The oxygen, of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189860,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The oxygen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190940,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are there any ingredients that we're missing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195140,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Carbon dioxide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198140,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would it surprise you to find out that 95% \nof a tree is actually from carbon dioxide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204040,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trees are largely made up of air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206040,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah.\n--Surprising."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208160,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need this reaction like, \"Oh holy sh--"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212380,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[laughing]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214200,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as it turns out trees are mostly made out of air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218020,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out of the carbon dioxide that they take in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220400,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's interesting is that we breathe\nout carbon dioxide and water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223820,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's how we lose mass"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225760,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's the exact same substances\n that trees breathe in to gain mass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229680,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you can imagine a closed system \nwhere it's just you and a tree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233540,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You would breathe out that carbon\ndioxide and water the tree would take it in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237680,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you would get smaller \nwhile the tree is getting bigger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242400,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in a sense you're becoming the tree."
    } ]
  } ]
}
